# PulmoSlicer AI extension descriptor for 3D Slicer.
scm git
scmurl https://github.com/pulmoslicer/PulmoSlicerAI
scmrevision local
depends TotalSegmentator
recommends SlicerVMTK SegmentEditorExtraEffects MarkupsToModel
build_subdirectory slicer_extension
homepage https://github.com/pulmoslicer/PulmoSlicerAI
contributors PulmoSlicer AI research team
category Chest by bsquochoainew
iconurl
status Experimental
tier 5
description Research pulmonary CT reconstruction using TotalSegmentator outputs; clinician review required.
screenshoturls
enabled 1
dicom_support_rule
keywords lung pulmonary CT segmentation reconstruction
